  << /ActualText (\042 Lead visual execution for multi\055market marketing campaigns across digital and print channels\054 ensuring brand consistency across formats and local markets\056\n\042 Develop campaign concepts and visual systems for social media\054 digital advertising\054 email marketing\054 landing pages\054 catalogs\054 presentations and promotional materials\056\n\042 Translate marketing objectives and commercial briefs into clear\054 engaging visual communication tailored to audiences\054 channels and campaign goals\056\n\042 Adapt key visuals across desktop\054 mobile\054 social\054 e\055commerce and print formats while maintaining hierarchy and campaign consistency\056\n\042 Collaborate with marketing\054 e\055commerce and cross\055market teams throughout the creative process\054 from concept development to final production\056\n\042 Review and refine creative output\054 establish reusable templates and support visual consistency across ongoing campaigns\056\n\042 Manage multiple campaigns and fast\055turnaround design requests simultaneously while maintaining quality and accuracy\056\n\042 Use Figma\054 Adobe Creative Suite and AI\055assisted tools to accelerate ideation\054 production and multi\055format adaptation\056)
     /K [ 6 ]
     /P 1402 0 R
     /Pg 1389 0 R
     /S /Span
